    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>The Arg'garok is a rarely seen weapon created by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gamorreans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gamorreans\">Gamorreans</a> and prized by their greatest warriors. The Arg'garok resembles nothing more than a huge axe, balanced so that only the strongest and best-trained warriors can use it effectively. </p><p>Any character attempting to wield an Arg'garok without a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> score of 15 or higher suffers a -5 penalty on attack rolls with the weapon. <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gamorreans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gamorreans\">Gamorreans</a> treat the Arg'garok as an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Advanced Melee Weapon\">Advanced Melee Weapon</a> instead of an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Melee)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon (Melee)\">Exotic Weapon (Melee)</a>. </p>",
